<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>赤印夹壳 · 动作工作台</title>
<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#101522;color:#e6edf8;font:15px system-ui}header{padding:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #344159}h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:25px}button,select{background:#26334b;color:inherit;border:1px solid #526684;padding:10px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:6px}nav{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:20px}button.active{background:#365f98}main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:240px 1fr;gap:24px;padding:24px}aside button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0}canvas{max-width:100%;image-rendering:pixelated;background:repeating-conic-gradient(#293449 0 25%,#344158 0 50%) 0/24px 24px}.meta{color:#a9bbd5;line-height:1.8}.controls{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:15px 0}input{width:300px}.panel{background:#192237;padding:20px;border-radius:10px}a{color:#8fcaff}@media(max-width:650px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
<header><h1>赤印夹壳 · 第一关 Boss 动作工作台</h1><div class="meta">制作候选 → 确认动作 → 游戏绑定 · <span id="budget">生成预算 0 / 80 秒</span></div><nav><button data-tab="work" class="active">工作中</button><button data-tab="confirmed">已确认</button><button data-tab="game">游戏绑定</button></nav></header>
<main><aside id="actions"></aside><section class="panel"><h2 id="title"></h2><p id="status" class="meta"></p><div id="candidates" class="controls"></div><video id="video" controls loop muted style="width:48%;vertical-align:top" hidden></video><canvas width="576" height="576" id="preview"></canvas><div class="controls"><button id="play">暂停</button><button id="prev">←</button><button id="next">→</button><span id="frame"></span></div><label>播放速度 <select id="speed"><option value="0.5">0.5×</option><option value="1" selected>1×</option><option value="1.5">1.5×</option></select></label><div id="editing" class="controls" hidden></div><p id="message" role="status"></p><div id="filmstrip" aria-label="全部动作帧" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;max-height:330px;overflow:auto;margin-top:16px"></div><p id="detail" class="meta"></p><p class="meta">逐帧查看：左右箭头。确认和绑定均需对应实际候选，不会把机器检查通过自动记作已确认。</p></section></main>
<script src="app.js"></script></html>
